      "structure_description": "A twisted-boat-shaped, approximately 4.0 nm long molecular ring with a Eu22 cyclic axis surrounded by 14 Ti ions. The reported structural decomposition comprises four {Ln3Ti2–MSA} and two {Ln3Ti3–MSA} units linked with four additional Ln ions; this decomposition is not evidence that the units were isolated as separate crystals."
